mode: "100644"
text: "# The TRIBE framework — build a Facebook Group as your organic surface\n\nGroups are the **10–30× Page-reach goldmine** — but only if you run them as a **community, not a broadcast.**\nTRIBE structures the play. The agent **designs the strategy + drafts the group posts + drafts the Page/\ncross-channel content that drives joins**; **WoopSocial publishes the Page + cross-channel funnel content\n(not group posts)**; **in-group posting, admin, and moderation are human/native → `community-management`.**\n\n## T — Treat it as a community asset, not a broadcast\n- A niche, **keyword-rich** group, **Private (Visible)**, with **2–3 membership questions** + clear rules.\n  The 10–30× Page-reach goldmine — **community engineering, not broadcasting.**\n\n## R — Run two-way engagement daily\n- Daily varied posts, **polls**, **short-form video (~3×)**; respond in the **first 30–60 min** (velocity/MSI).\n  **Never post-and-ghost.**\n\n## I — Invite quality, not blasts\n- **Email list + social** (target ~30% acceptance / ~40% retention), **non-competing admin partnerships**, a\n  **lead magnet**, **ads to the join link**, and **genuine** cross-posting in related groups. **200–500/month**\n  — *no bulk-poster automation or bought members (ToS/ban risk; tanks ratios).*\n\n## B — Build trust before selling\n- **Value first, trust second, sales third.** **No selling in the first 30 days.** A warm niche →\n  ~20–23% conversion / **$3–15K/mo.** The community is the product.\n\n## E — Extend from the Page (and keep the group native)\n- **WoopSocial publishes the Page + cross-channel content that drives joins** (the funnel). The **in-group\n  posting, admin, membership questions, moderation + Group analytics are human/native** →\n  `community-management` + `crisis-and-moderation`.\n\n## The group plan a request should fill\n```\nASSET: niche + keyword-rich name + Private(Visible) + 2-3 membership questions + rules (the 10-30x goldmine)\nENGAGE: daily varied posts + polls + short video; respond in the first 30-60 min; no sell first 30 days; no ghosting\nGROW: email/social invites (30%/40%) + admin partnerships + lead magnet + ads to join link + genuine cross-posting (200-500/mo; no automation/bots)\nMONETIZE: value first -> trust -> sales; warm niche -> offers/coaching/membership (never fabricate revenue)\nPUBLISH (WoopSocial): the PAGE + cross-channel posts that drive joins -- NOT group posts. In-group posting/admin/moderation native -> community-management.\n```\n"
